# LMS

- Monorepo layout: backend solution under `src/backend`, Angular under `src/frontend/aganox-lms-web`.
- JWT may be used when OIDC disabled; prefer OIDC path aligned with Identity for new auth work.
- Production artifacts: `scripts/publish-server.ps1`, `build-installer.ps1` — do not check large binaries into git.
- Design docs in `docs/design/` describe target architecture; code may lag — note gaps in PR text.